---
import { MILESTONES } from '../../data/milestones';
import { type Locale } from '../../i18n';

interface Props {
  locale?: Locale;
}

const { locale = 'es' } = Astro.props;
const milestone = MILESTONES[6];
---

<section 
  id="scene-7" 
  class="scene" 
  data-scene="shanks" 
  data-year={milestone.year}
  data-pi-value={milestone.precisionValue}
  data-theme={milestone.theme}
  data-scene-title={milestone.title[locale]}
>
  <div class="stage">
    <!-- Dome Spiral Rig (Palais de la Découverte 707 digits) -->
    <div class="dome-stage" id="shanks-dome">
      <div class="dome-circle-track">
        <!-- Visual segment around digit 528 -->
        <div class="digits-spiral">
          <span class="d-chunk d-valid">...525: 4 9 3 0</span>
          <!-- THE FATAL DIGIT 528 -->
          <span class="d-fatal" id="shanks-fatal-528">
            <span class="fatal-index">#528</span>
            <strong class="fatal-digit">4</strong>
            <span class="fatal-correct-hint">era 5</span>
          </span>
          <!-- The 180 crumbling digits that collapse into ash -->
          <div class="crumbling-ash-stream" id="crumbling-stream">
            <span class="d-crumb c-1">3</span>
            <span class="d-crumb c-2">8</span>
            <span class="d-crumb c-3">1</span>
            <span class="d-crumb c-4">9</span>
            <span class="d-crumb c-5">5</span>
            <span class="d-crumb c-6">2</span>
            <span class="d-crumb c-7">8</span>
            <span class="d-crumb c-8">4</span>
            <span class="d-crumb c-9">7</span>
            <span class="d-crumb c-10">5... [180 dígitos destruidos]</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Narrative Center (Uncollapsible, balanced typography) -->
    <div class="narrative">
      <div class="beat" data-beat="0.05-0.38">
        <span class="scene-kicker">07 // HOUGHTON-LE-SPRING, 1873 · INGLATERRA</span>
        <h2 class="scene-title">{milestone.title[locale]}</h2>
        <p class="beat-text">
          {locale === 'es'
            ? 'William Shanks dedicó veinte años de su existencia a calcular a mano, con pluma y tintero, 707 cifras de π. En 1937, la Exposición Universal de París rindió homenaje a su hazaña tallando sus 707 números en madera dorada alrededor de la cúpula del Palais de la Découverte.'
            : 'William Shanks surrendered twenty years of his life calculating by hand, with ink and quill, 707 decimal places of π. In 1937, the Paris Universal Exposition honored his titan sacrifice by carving all 707 numerals in gilded wood around the dome of the Palais de la Découverte.'}
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="beat" data-beat="0.42-0.80">
        <span class="scene-kicker">07 // EL DÍGITO #528 Y LA CENIZA</span>
        <h2 class="scene-title">El Cortocircuito de 1946</h2>
        <p class="beat-text">
          {locale === 'es'
            ? 'En 1946, el matemático D.F. Ferguson utilizó una calculadora mecánica y detectó una tragedia: Shanks se equivocó en el decimal 528. Como una fila de fichas de dominó, los últimos 180 dígitos que le costaron años de vida —y que brillaban en el techo de París— eran pura ceniza errónea.'
            : 'In 1946, mathematician D.F. Ferguson deployed a mechanical desk calculator and uncovered a tragedy: Shanks had stumbled at decimal 528. Like a collapsing domino run, the final 180 digits that cost decades of his mortal life —and glowed on the Paris ceiling— were false ash.'}
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="beat beat-climax" data-beat="0.84-0.98">
        <blockquote class="shanks-quote">
          <p>«Veinte años de cálculo manual se desmoronaron por un solo desliz en la tinta. La era de la mente humana sola ante el infinito llegaba a su fin.»</p>
          <cite>— D.F. Ferguson (1946)</cite>
        </blockquote>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  const dome = document.getElementById('shanks-dome');
  const fatalEl = document.getElementById('shanks-fatal-528');
  const streamEl = document.getElementById('crumbling-stream');

  if (dome) {
    const scene = dome.closest('[data-scene]') as HTMLElement | null;
    window.addEventListener('scroll', () => {
      if (!scene) return;
      const p = parseFloat(getComputedStyle(scene).getPropertyValue('--p')) || 0;
      const isFailed = p > 0.55;

      fatalEl?.classList.toggle('is-error', isFailed);
      streamEl?.classList.toggle('is-fallen', isFailed);
    }, { passive: true });
  }
</script>

<style>
  .scene {
    height: 380vh;
    position: relative;
    --p: 0;
  }

  .stage {
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    height: 100vh;
    width: 100%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, #1e1114 0%, #0a0607 100%);
    padding: 0 20px;
  }

  /* Uncollapsible Narrative Box */
  .narrative {
    position: absolute;
    top: 10vh;
    width: 100% !important;
    max-width: min(90vw, 740px) !important;
    margin: 0 auto !important;
    text-align: center !important;
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 5;
  }

  .beat {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translate3d(0, 16px, 0);
    transition: opacity 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    top: 0;
    width: 100% !important;
  }

  .beat.is-active {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translate3d(0, 0, 0);
    pointer-events: auto;
  }

  .scene-kicker {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    color: #e63946;
    display: inline-block;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }

  .scene-title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.8vw, 2.8rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    color: #fff;
    margin: 0 0 10px;
    text-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);
  }

  .beat-text {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: clamp(0.95rem, 1.8vw, 1.12rem);
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin: 0;
    text-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);
  }

  .shanks-quote {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 2.8vw, 1.9rem);
    font-style: italic;
    color: #e63946;
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin: 0;
    text-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(230, 57, 70, 0.5);
  }

  .shanks-quote cite {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-style: normal;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
    margin-top: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  /* Dome Spiral Rig */
  .dome-stage {
    margin-top: 20vh;
    width: min(92vw, 740px);
    background: rgba(20, 12, 14, 0.9);
    border: 1px solid rgba(230, 57, 70, 0.3);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 24px;
    box-shadow: 0 25px 70px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .dome-circle-track {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .digits-spiral {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
  }

  .d-valid {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: #ffd700;
  }

  /* Fatal 528 Digit */
  .d-fatal {
    position: relative;
    display: inline-flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 6px 14px;
    border: 2px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .fatal-index {
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
  }

  .fatal-digit {
    font-size: 2rem;
    color: #ffd700;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .fatal-correct-hint {
    font-size: 0.6rem;
    color: #00ffcc;
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
  }

  .d-fatal.is-error {
    border-color: #e63946;
    background: rgba(230, 57, 70, 0.2);
    box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(230, 57, 70, 0.6);
  }

  .d-fatal.is-error .fatal-digit {
    color: #e63946;
    text-shadow: 0 0 15px #e63946;
  }

  .d-fatal.is-error .fatal-correct-hint {
    opacity: 1;
  }

  /* Crumbling Ash Stream */
  .crumbling-ash-stream {
    display: inline-flex;
    gap: 8px;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: #ffd700;
    transition: all 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
  }

  .crumbling-ash-stream.is-fallen {
    transform: translateY(80px) rotate(8deg);
    opacity: 0.15;
    filter: grayscale(1) blur(2px);
  }
</style>
